In addition, shrines that existed at the time of the compilation of the {{ill|Engishiki|de|Engishiki|ja|延喜式|zh|延喜式|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Engishiki|qq=}} god name records but which are not listed in those records—the so‑called “{{ill|Shikigai Shrine|de|Shikigai Shrine|ja|式外社|1=Shikigeisha|zh|式外社|1=Shikigeisha|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Shikigai Shrine|13=User:Immanuelle/Shikigeisha|qq=}}”—are also noted.
